  ],
  "crossCheck": "Every value referenced in the captured conditionalFieldsConfig blobs - Estoppel, New Lease, Vendor Change, Amendment - is present in this list. Confirms the conditional rules key off this firm-defined table.",
  "fragility": "crtVal1 in conditionalFieldsConfig stores the DISPLAY LABEL, not the id. Renaming any of these 13 values silently breaks every rule referencing it. 'Estoppel' alone appears in roughly 20 captured rules."
 },
